# Trivy baseline for the TinyChat backend image (deploy-backend-phala.yml, "Scan the backend image").
# The deploy scans with --severity CRITICAL,HIGH --ignore-unfixed and fails on any finding NOT listed here.
# Recorded 2026-11-22 with trivy 0.76.2 against the production image
# ghcr.io/tinycloudlabs/tinychat-backend@sha256:4cb7e82acdf7c59d46e47143d2208426289e9991120e974f1273791f4350353d
# (revision a499c7c2f4bd705907ed400a8a7f14f4a7268ca7, @tinychat/backend@0.9.5; bun.lock and backend/Dockerfile are
# unchanged on main since). These are known, fixable findings that ship today; listing them here is not acceptance.
# Remove an entry once the image no longer has it. Never add one without a security review.

